{"speciesId":471,"names":{"fr":"Givrali","es":"Glaceon","en":"Glaceon","ja":"グレイシア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It causes small ice crystals to form by lowering the temperature of the surrounding atmosphere."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It causes small ice crystals to form by lowering the temperature of the surrounding atmosphere."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ajuste la température de son corps pour créer un vent de glace en gelant l’air qui l’entoure."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ajuste la température de son corps pour créer un vent de glace en gelant l’air qui l’entoure."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ajuste la température de son corps pour créer un vent de glace en gelant l’air qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Controla su temperatura corporal para congelar el ambiente y causar ráfagas de nieve en polvo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体温を コントロールすることで 周囲の 空気を 凍らせて ダイヤモンドダストを 降らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il abaisse la température de son corps pour changer ses poils en aiguilles de glace qu’il projette sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al reducir su temperatura corporal, su pelaje se congela y se convierte en afilados pinchos que puede disparar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体温を さげることで 全身の 体毛を 凍らせて 鋭く とがった 針のようにして 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il ajuste la température de son corps pour créer un vent de glace en gelant l’air qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Controla su temperatura corporal para congelar el ambiente y causar ráfagas de nieve en polvo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体温を コントロールすることで 周囲の 空気を 凍らせて ダイヤモンドダストを 降らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il abaisse la température de son corps pour changer ses poils en aiguilles de glace qu’il projette sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al reducir su temperatura corporal, su pelaje se congela y se convierte en afilados pinchos que puede disparar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体温を さげることで 全身の 体毛を 凍らせて 鋭く とがった 針のようにして 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il peut contrôler la température de son corps à volonté et générer des cristaux de glace en gelant l’humidité de l’air."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Controla a su antojo la temperatura corporal y congela las partículas de agua que flotan en el aire para provocar ráfagas de nieve en polvo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can control its body temperature at will. This enables it to freeze the moisture in the atmosphere, creating flurries of diamond dust."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"体温を 自在に コントロールし 大気の 水分を 凍らせて ダイヤモンドダストを 巻き起こす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il gèle ses poils pour les transformer en pics de glace, qu’il utilise ensuite pour terrasser ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al congelar su pelaje, este se eriza formando carámbanos con los que ataca a su presa en cuanto la avista."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It freezes its fur into icicles, spiky and sharp, and tackles its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"体毛を 凍らせ 鋭い 氷柱の ように 尖らせてから 獲物を 目掛け タックルする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Pour se protéger, il gèle ses poils jusqu’à les transformer en picots de glace. Sa température corporelle peut descendre jusqu’à -60 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Congela su pelaje y lo convierte en afilados pinchos para defenderse. Es capaz de reducir su temperatura corporal hasta -60 ºC."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It protects itself by freezing its fur into sharp needles. It can drop its body temperature below –75 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"体毛を 凍らせ 鋭い ハリに 変えて 身を 守る。 体温は マイナス６０度まで 下げられるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il gèle les particules d’eau qui l’entourent pour former de petits cristaux de glace, qu’il utilise ensuite pour lapider ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"En un solo instante congela las partículas de agua a su alrededor y crea cristales de hielo con los que ataca a su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It can instantaneously freeze any moisture that’s around it, creating ice pellets to shoot at its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"一瞬で 周囲の 水分を 凍らせ 氷の 粒を 作り 獲物 めがけて 撃ちだすのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Totalement subjuguées par la beauté des cristaux de glace qu’il fait tomber, ses proies ne réalisent que trop tard qu’elles sont en train de geler."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Desprende cristales de hielo. Sus presas se quedan congeladas sin darse cuenta, encandiladas por su belleza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Any who become captivated by the beauty of the snowfall that Glaceon creates will be frozen before they know it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ダイヤモンドダストを 降らせる。 美しさに 見惚れた 獲物は 気づかぬうちに 凍りついている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon exhale un vent glacial qui crée une neige poudreuse. Sa présence est très appréciée dans les stations de ski."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El aire gélido que exhala crea una suerte de cristales de hielo que lo hace muy demandado en las estaciones de esquí."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The coldness emanating from Glaceon causes powdery snow to form, making it quite a popular Pokémon at ski resorts."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"グレイシアが 放つ 冷気は パウダースノーを つくりだし スキー場に ひっぱりだこ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Glaceon is able to lower its body temperature very quickly. It freezes the atmosphere, creating diamond dust that glitters like gems while it flutters and dances around."}],"varieties":[{"id":471,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",5],[23,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"le